# BUG-H4J78: Auth page keeps the previous email after signing out

- **Priority:** P2
- **Component:** Identity
- **Environment:** Web app v4.8.1 on Windows, Edge
- **Steps to reproduce:**
  1. Open the shopping app and sign in with an email address.
  2. Sign out, then open the sign-in page again.
  3. Check the email field.
- **Expected:** The email field is blank after signing out.
- **Actual:** The email field still contains the address used before signing out, causing a minor privacy annoyance.
- **Repro code:**
  ```js
  await page.goto('/login');
  await page.locator('input[type=email]').fill('florence@example.com');
  await page.getByRole('button', { name: /sign in/i }).click();
  await page.getByRole('button', { name: /sign out/i }).click();
  await page.goto('/login');
  console.log(await page.locator('input[type=email]').inputValue());
  ```
